{"municipality_code":"02406","pref":"青森県","city":"横浜町","headline":"文化施設や寺社仏閣が、この街を歩く手がかりになりそうです。","display_comment_enriched":"横浜町には、横浜村など、近世の村々の記憶を伝える地名が残っています。 周辺には寺社や信仰の場、史跡や遺跡にまつわる場所が点在し、「横浜館跡」、「西福寺」、「八幡神社」などを起点に歩くと、地域の歴史がぐっと見えやすくなります。 現地では史跡説明板、横浜村ゆかりの旧境石標や村の歴史案内板を既存ピンと照らし合わせながら歩くと、見落としがちな地域の物語に出会いやすくなります。 「菜の花畑」や「平成」などの名所も、地域の物語を深掘りする絶好の入口です。 さらに、「ナマコ南蛮漬け」や「横浜ナマコ」といった名物や食文化に触れると、その土地らしい暮らしまで感じられるでしょう。","radar_groups":[{"id":"town","title":"街の基盤","metrics":[{"id":"dining","label":"飲食店","short_label":"飲食","count":4,"rank":1493,"percentile":19.4,"national_average":234.0,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"parks","label":"公園・遊具","short_label":"公園","count":1,"rank":1311,"percentile":22.8,"national_average":35.1,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"public","label":"公共施設","short_label":"公共","count":6,"rank":1793,"percentile":4.4,"national_average":39.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"culture","label":"文化施設","short_label":"文化","count":6,"rank":1248,"percentile":28.2,"national_average":12.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"landscape","label":"景観・樹木","short_label":"景観","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.2,"municipality_total":1896}]},{"id":"history","title":"歴史資産","metrics":[{"id":"temples_shrines","label":"寺社仏閣","short_label":"寺社","count":2,"rank":1181,"percentile":27.7,"national_average":8.9,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"historic_sites","label":"史跡・遺跡","short_label":"史跡","count":1,"rank":1445,"percentile":12.5,"national_average":7.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"roads_posts","label":"街道・宿場","short_label":"街道","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":1.2,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"villages","label":"近世村","short_label":"近世村","count":1,"rank":1563,"percentile":14.5,"national_average":31.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"civil","label":"土木遺産","short_label":"土木","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.3,"municipality_total":1896}]}],"culture_cards":{"notable_people":[],"tourism_landmarks":["菜の花畑","